SOLAR POWER BLADE CHARGING MOUNTAIN OUTRIDE GRILL
Dewalt tools battery charger offers easy, efficient charging of many different battery types and is compatible with battery storage from many manufacturers. The DC1102DC1260RX is recommended for use in Europe, Middle-East and Africa and is for single cell, 2-cell or 3-cell battery use and up to 2.5Vdc output.
